---
title: State Diagram - transaction status (FR-22)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Assessing : transfer passed validation

    state "Risk assessment" as Assessing

    Assessing --> APPROVED : LOW risk (score 0-29)
    Assessing --> PENDING_VERIFICATION : MEDIUM risk (score 30-59)
    Assessing --> PENDING : HIGH risk (score 60+)

    state "PENDING_VERIFICATION<br/>funds reserved, not moved" as PENDING_VERIFICATION
    state "PENDING<br/>held for fraud review,<br/>funds reserved, not moved" as PENDING
    state "APPROVED<br/>money moved" as APPROVED
    state "BLOCKED<br/>stopped, no money moved" as BLOCKED
    state "FAILED<br/>could not be completed" as FAILED

    PENDING_VERIFICATION --> APPROVED : correct code within 3 attempts
    PENDING_VERIFICATION --> BLOCKED : 3 wrong attempts, or the code expired
    PENDING --> APPROVED : analyst approves the case
    PENDING --> BLOCKED : analyst blocks the case

    PENDING --> FAILED : balance insufficient at release
    PENDING_VERIFICATION --> FAILED : balance insufficient at release

    APPROVED --> [*]
    BLOCKED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]

    note right of APPROVED
        APPROVED, BLOCKED and FAILED are final.
        Any attempt to change a final transaction
        is rejected with INVALID_STATE.
    end note
